 "Step 2 is exactly a function of (x1,|x0|,x0): h2 = relu(x1*Wx + |x0|*A + x0*B), A=0.5|Wx|@Wh, B=0.5Wx@Wh, so its range is the cone "
 "generated by relu(Wx +/-(A+B)); 7 coordinates on that cone carry the whole later computation. "
 "Step 3: its pre-activation z3 = x2*Wx + h2@Wh lives in the 8-dimensional span of Wx and the 7 cone directions pushed through Wh, so "
