import numpy as np
DESCRIPTION = ("TASK: the network reports the POSITION of the SECOND-LARGEST of the 10 inputs. "
 "Units with big input weights (units 1,4,6,7,8 have Wx=-10.6,+10.2,-11.0,-13.2,-12.3) are comparators: the state carries the "
 "running best value on positive 'memory' units, so relu(Wx*x_t + Wh memory) fires exactly when the new input beats (unit 4) or "
 "loses to (unit 7) the carried value; small units 10-13 integrate those comparisons into a position code that the readout turns "
 "into a per-position class score. "
 "Step 1 is exactly rank 2: h1 = relu(x0*Wx) = 0.5*(|x0|*|Wx| + x0*Wx). "
 "Step 2 is exactly a function of (x1,|x0|,x0): h2 = relu(x1*Wx + |x0|*A + x0*B), A=0.5|Wx|@Wh, B=0.5Wx@Wh, so its range is the "
 "cone generated by relu(Wx +/-(A+B)); 7 coordinates on that cone carry everything later. "
 "Step 3: its pre-activation z3 = x2*Wx + h2@Wh lives in the 8-dimensional fan {Wx, Q2@Wh}, so h3 = relu(z3) needs only 10 gate "
 "coordinates relu(Gs@c) on that fan (c a sign pattern). "
 "The decision only depends on DIFFERENCES of the 10 class scores (a common shift of every class score per input cannot change the "
 "argmax), so the readout is written relative to class 0: column 0 of Wo is exactly zero and Wo[:,j] holds Wo_orig[:,j]-Wo_orig[:,0]. "
 "Steps 4..10 are carried exactly (still partly a diagnostic re-description).")
